    "over the phone.\r"
    "You seem to be there when\n"
    "something exciting happens,\f"
    "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
    "You are making me all excited!\n"
    "I’ll give you a present for that.\f"
    "Please take it.\r"
}

